    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i have these really bad migraines like all the time but today was different. i got this sudden intense headache and while it was happening i noticed my speech felt kind of thick/slurred and my mouth felt a bit droopy on one side. is that just like a weird migraine aura thing? i'm kinda scared to go to the er if it's just a bad migraine",
