      "content": "but honestly i feel better now that the pain is dulling a bit. the drooping isn't as obvious as it was 20 mins ago. my doctor usually says i just get \"complex migraines\" and they can be super weird like that. if the symptoms are already fading, does that mean it's definitely just an aura and not something like a stroke? i really don't want to sit in an ER for 8 hours if i'm fine",
